  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Oversight of the US Department of State&#x2019;s Bureau of International Narcotics and Law Enforcement Affairs Projects in Balochistan, Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to extend its partnership with the US Department of State&#x2019;s Bureau of International Narcotics and Law Enforcement Affairs in Pakistan (INL-P) for the monitoring and evaluation of projects for law enforcement agencies (LEAs) in Baluchistan, Pakistan with the following objectives: (1) complete the LEAs infrastructure facilities according to the agreed design, timeline, and standard operating procedures; (2) assess the achievement of the outcomes agreed between the Government of Pakistan and INL-P; (3) enable INL-P to be informed of the progress of the projects and see the significance of its assistance in strengthening institutional capacities of the LEAs and controlling criminal, militant and narcotics activities.</narrative>
  </description>
